{"title":"Free Friday night movie @ Innis Town Hall. Deliverance","startsAt":"2026-10-23T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-23T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"🏕️ Free Movie Night: Deliverance — A Classic That Will Make You Think Twice About Camping!\n\nLooking for something a little darker this Halloween season? Join us Friday, October 23 at Innis Town Hall for a FREE screening of the 1972 survival thriller Deliverance. 🎬\n\n📍 Innis Town Hall\n2 Sussex Avenue, Toronto\n🎬 Movie starts: 7:10 PM\n⏱️ Runtime: 109 minutes\n\n🌲 About the Movie\n\nFour friends head into the wilderness for a canoe trip down a remote river before a proposed dam changes the landscape forever.\n\nWhat begins as an adventurous weekend quickly becomes a fight for survival as they encounter increasingly dangerous circumstances deep in the backcountry.\n\nStarring Jon Voight, Burt Reynolds, Ned Beatty and Ronny Cox, Deliverance is one of the most famous—and unsettling—survival movies ever made.\n\n🎥 Watch the trailer on YouTube:\n\"Watch the Deliverance (1972) Trailer\" ([https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Deliverance+1972+official+trailer](https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Deliverance+1972+official+trailer))\n\n👋 Meet Nick\n\nMeet Nick in the lobby before the movie.\nI'll have a Meetup sign so you can easily find me.\n\n💰 FREE EVENT!\n\nThere are NO charges or fees for this Meetup.\n\nPlease respect your RSVP—if you RSVP, please make every effort to attend.\n\nNot sure about your schedule yet? That's okay! You can simply just show up if you're unsure whether you'll be able to make it. No pressure to RSVP.\n\nCome out, meet some fellow movie fans, and experience one of the most iconic—and unforgettable—films of the 1970s. 🏕️🎬\n\nJust remember: this is probably not the movie to watch right before planning your next canoe trip. 😬","venue":{"name":"Innis Town Hall","address":"University of Toronto - St. George Campus, 2 Sussex Avenue, Toronto, Toronto","lat":43.66556,"lng":-79.39956,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/3/2/e/highres_536349006.jpeg"}